IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `je21-nouns`
IMPORT `je21-art03-commencement`

-- je21-art26-commencement: Article 26 (Citation and commencement) of the Legislation (Jersey) Law 2021 (L.8/2021), with the endnotes that say when it came into force and which text governs.
-- Articles 24 and 25 and Schedules 2 and 3 are spent and omitted from the deposited texts (endnotes [5] to [8]); they are in the coverage table of NOTES.md.
--
-- Article 26 says the Law "comes into force on a day to be specified by the States by Act".
-- The Act itself, R&O.112/2021, is not among the deposited sources.
-- The day, 28 September 2021, is taken from the endnotes' Table of Legislation History, which gives one commencement for the whole Law.
-- The model takes that day to be the day on which each Part came into force, because the endnotes name no other day:
-- Articles 3(6) and 11(4) speak of the commencement of Part 2, and Articles 13(1) and 16(1)(a) of the commencement of Part 3.
--
-- Two texts of the Law are deposited: as it stood from 28 September 2021 to 10 January 2024, and from 11 January 2024 to the date the page was retrieved (27 October 2026).
-- Endnote [2] records that Article 2(1) was revised on 11 January 2024 by a Law Revision Board item.
-- The model does not know of any later change to the text, and answers every day after 10 January 2024 with the text of 11 January 2024; a revision after the retrieval date would change that answer.

§ `Article 26 -- Citation and commencement`

§§ `26 When the Law came into force`

-- Answers: on what day did the Law come into force?
-- src:223 | This Law may be cited as the Legislation (Jersey) Law 2021 and comes into force on a day to be specified by the States by Act.
-- src:258 | (Jersey) Law 2021
-- src:259 | L.8/2021
-- src:260 | 28
-- src:261 | September 2021 (R&O.112/2021)
@ref Legislation (Jersey) Law 2021, Article 26 and the endnotes' Table of Legislation History (src:223, src:258-261)
GIVETH A DATE
`Article 26: the day on which the Law came into force` MEANS YMD 2021 9 28

-- Answers: how do the endnotes record the commencement of the Law?
-- The endnotes give the day and the number of the Act; Article 26 says the day is specified by Act of the States.
-- src:223 | This Law may be cited as the Legislation (Jersey) Law 2021 and comes into force on a day to be specified by the States by Act.
-- src:258 | (Jersey) Law 2021
-- src:259 | L.8/2021
-- src:260 | 28
-- src:261 | September 2021 (R&O.112/2021)
@ref Legislation (Jersey) Law 2021, Article 26 and the endnotes' Table of Legislation History (src:223, src:258-261)
GIVETH A STRING
`Article 26: the commencement of the Law, as the endnotes record it` MEANS "28 September 2021 (R&O.112/2021), the day specified by Act of the States under Article 26"

-- Answers: was the Law in force at some time on the day asked about?
-- It was from the day it came into force, whatever time of day that was.
-- src:223 | This Law may be cited as the Legislation (Jersey) Law 2021 and comes into force on a day to be specified by the States by Act.
-- src:258 | (Jersey) Law 2021
-- src:259 | L.8/2021
-- src:260 | 28
-- src:261 | September 2021 (R&O.112/2021)
@ref Legislation (Jersey) Law 2021, Article 26 and the endnotes' Table of Legislation History (src:223, src:258-261)
GIVEN `the day asked about` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 26: the Law was in force at some time on the day` `the day asked about` MEANS
    `the day asked about` AT LEAST `Article 26: the day on which the Law came into force`

-- Answers: at what moment did the Law come into force?
-- An Act that names a day brings the Law into force at the beginning of that day, by Article 3(2), unless provision is made to the contrary.
-- The sources do not say that the Act made provision to the contrary, and they do not give its text; fork L3 is the other reading.
-- src:48 | (2) If any Jersey legislation is expressed to come into force on a particular day, it is treated as coming into force at the beginning of that day, unless provision is made to the contrary.
-- src:258 | (Jersey) Law 2021
-- src:259 | L.8/2021
-- src:260 | 28
-- src:261 | September 2021 (R&O.112/2021)
@ref Legislation (Jersey) Law 2021, Article 3(2) and the endnotes' Table of Legislation History (src:48, src:258-261)
GIVEN reading IS A `Reading L3 of the time at which the Law came into force`
GIVETH A `Moment of coming into force`
`Article 26 and Article 3(2): the moment at which the Law came into force` reading MEANS
    CONSIDER reading
    WHEN `the beginning of 28 September 2021, by Article 3(2)` THEN `from the beginning of the day` `Article 26: the day on which the Law came into force`
    WHEN `the sources do not state it, so a question that turns on a time of day on 28 September 2021 is refused` THEN `at a time on the day that the Law does not state` `Article 26: the day on which the Law came into force`

-- Answers: was the Law in force at a given time of day on the day asked about?
-- Before 28 September 2021: no.
-- After it: yes.
-- On it: from the beginning of the day, yes; on the other reading, refused.
-- src:48 | (2) If any Jersey legislation is expressed to come into force on a particular day, it is treated as coming into force at the beginning of that day, unless provision is made to the contrary.
-- src:258 | (Jersey) Law 2021
-- src:259 | L.8/2021
-- src:260 | 28
-- src:261 | September 2021 (R&O.112/2021)
@ref Legislation (Jersey) Law 2021, Article 3(2) and the endnotes' Table of Legislation History (src:48, src:258-261)
GIVEN `the day asked about` IS A DATE
      `the time of day asked about` IS A `Time of day`
      reading IS A `Reading L3 of the time at which the Law came into force`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 26: the Law was in force at a time of day on the day` `the day asked about` `the time of day asked about` reading MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the day asked about` LESS THAN `Article 26: the day on which the Law came into force` THEN FALSE
        IF `the day asked about` GREATER THAN `Article 26: the day on which the Law came into force` THEN TRUE
        OTHERWISE
            CONSIDER reading
            WHEN `the beginning of 28 September 2021, by Article 3(2)`
                THEN `Article 3: the provision was in force at a time of day on the day` (`Article 26 and Article 3(2): the moment at which the Law came into force` reading) `the day asked about` `the time of day asked about`
            WHEN `the sources do not state it, so a question that turns on a time of day on 28 September 2021 is refused`
                THEN REFUSE "the sources do not say at what time of day on 28 September 2021 the Law came into force, so whether it was in force at a given time of day that day cannot be answered"

§§ `Which text of the Law governs a day`

-- Answers: which text of the Law governs on the day asked about?
-- Before 28 September 2021 the Law was not in force.
-- From 28 September 2021 to 10 January 2024 the text is the one with "by order of Her Majesty in Council" in Article 2(1)(b).
-- From 11 January 2024 it is the one revised by endnote [2], with "by Order in Council".
-- The only change the endnote records between the two is that revision of Article 2(1)(b), and the model does not say whether anything else differs.
-- src:223 | This Law may be cited as the Legislation (Jersey) Law 2021 and comes into force on a day to be specified by the States by Act.
-- src:258 | (Jersey) Law 2021
-- src:259 | L.8/2021
-- src:260 | 28
-- src:261 | September 2021 (R&O.112/2021)
-- src:268 | [2] Article 2(1) revised
-- src:269 | on 11 January 2024 by Law Revision Board item 2023/1
@ref Legislation (Jersey) Law 2021, Article 26 and the endnotes (src:223, src:258-261, src:268-269)
GIVEN `the day asked about` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Text of the Legislation (Jersey) Law 2021`
`Article 26 and the endnotes: which text of the Law governs on the day` `the day asked about` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the day asked about` LESS THAN `Article 26: the day on which the Law came into force` THEN `the Law was not in force`
        IF `the day asked about` LESS THAN YMD 2024 1 11 THEN `the text of 28 September 2021`
        OTHERWISE `the text of 11 January 2024`
